Third-party software that this repository does not contain
----------------------------------------------------------

The build links Microsoft's Azure Kinect Body Tracking SDK (libk4abt) and
Azure Kinect Sensor SDK (libk4a). The Sensor SDK's source code is under the MIT
licence quoted above. At run time libk4a loads the depth engine
(libdepthengine). The depth engine and the Body Tracking SDK are proprietary
Microsoft binaries under the Microsoft Software License Terms that come with
them.

The tracker runs on Microsoft's ONNX Runtime (MIT licence) and, on the GPU, on
NVIDIA's CUDA libraries, cuDNN and TensorRT, which are under NVIDIA's licence
agreements (CUDA Toolkit End User License Agreement, Software License Agreement
for cuDNN, TensorRT Software License Agreement).

You install all of them separately; this repository contains no part of them.
